summary: Check drivers supported by sensors-detect
description: |
  Make sure that all the supported drivers are enabled in the
  sensors-detect script. For now it covers just BZ#473119.
contact: Laura Trivelloni <ltrivell@redhat.com>
test: bash ./runtest.sh
framework: beakerlib
require: 
  - lm_sensors
duration: 5m
extra-task: /kernel/lm_sensors/Sanity/detect
